sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Funder as Funder Contract<br/>(Sepolia)
    participant FunderRC as ReactiveFunderRC<br/>(Lasna)
    participant Callback as Callback Proxy<br/>(Sepolia)
    participant RSC as YieldOptimizerRsc<br/>(Lasna)

    Note over User,RSC: Self-Sustaining Gas Funding Pattern

    User->>Funder: send ETH (fees)
    Funder-->>FunderRC: emit FundsReceived(sender, amount)
    
    Note over FunderRC: Monitor balance thresholds
    
    alt Balance exceeds bridge threshold
        FunderRC->>FunderRC: Calculate bridge amount
        FunderRC->>Callback: emit Callback(coverDebt)
        Callback->>Funder: coverDebt(reactiveContract)
        Funder->>RSC: Bridge funds via depositTo()
        Note over RSC: RSC gas balance replenished
    end

    Note over RSC: RSC continues operation with new funds
    RSC->>RSC: Execute CRON checks
    RSC->>RSC: Process yield events
    RSC->>Callback: emit Callback(executeRebalance)
